  m_text: "<b><color=#6B57DD>Darkmeridional studio games</color></b>\nProyecto Productivo
    \xB7 SENA\nDesarrollo y dise\xF1o: Mario Andr\xE9s Jaramillo Arias\n\n<b><color=#6B57DD>Arte,
    animaci\xF3n y efectos de terceros</color></b>\nKevin Iglesias (Humanoid Giant)
    \xB7 Mixamo (animaciones) \xB7 Hovl Studio (Magic Effects) \xB7 SineVFX \xB7
    TriForge Assets \xB7 Selcuk Gerceker (Toon Environments) \xB7 IgniteCoders (Simple
    Water Shader) \xB7 Reversed Interactive (The Portal Collection) \xB7 Polytope
    Studio \xB7 IL3DN \xB7 Whaleride \xB7 Zacxophone \xB7 Pixit Games\n\nHecho con
    Unity 6"
